# Copy to .Renviron (gitignored) only if you need one of these. The tutorials,
# the app and the scripts set every BIOHTTP_CACHE_* variable themselves in
# R/demo-env.R, so nothing here is required for the demo.

# Optional: raises the ClinVar limit from 3 to 10 requests per second.
# Never committed. bioclients attaches it at dispatch only.
# NCBI_API_KEY=

# Optional: identifies you to services that ask for a contact. Not used by
# any live call in this project, but bioclients folds it into E-utilities
# URLs, so set it once and keep it stable.
# BIOHTTP_CONTACT_EMAIL=
